WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.701 --> 00:00:05.934
♪♪

00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:08.100
Narrator:
ORIGINATING IN THE MIDDLE EAST,

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.067
PITA BREAD HAS BEEN AROUND
FOR THOUSANDS OF YEARS.

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:15.067
TODAY, ITS POPULARITY CONTINUES
TO GROW AROUND THE GLOBE.

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:17.767
PART OF ITS APPEAL
IS ITS VERSATILITY.

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:20.033
PEOPLE CAN STUFF
THEIR PITA'S POCKETS,

00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:23.567
USE IT AS A SANDWICH WRAP,
OR SLICE IT FOR DIPPING.

00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:26.567
♪♪

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:28.400
PITA BREAD MAY BE FLAT,

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.501
BUT THAT DOESN'T MEAN
IT'S BORING.

00:00:30.501 --> 00:00:32.901
ANYONE CAN USE PITA
TO MAKE ANY NUMBER

00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:37.000
OF INTERESTING
LUNCHTIME COMBINATIONS.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.767
MAKING PITA BREAD STARTS
WITH SILOS FULL OF FLOUR.

00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:44.501
A BLOWER SYSTEM DELIVERS THE
FLOUR TO AN AUTOMATED SIFTER.

00:00:44.501 --> 00:00:47.734
THE SIFTER SHAKES THE FLOUR
THROUGH THREE LEVELS OF MESH

00:00:47.734 --> 00:00:49.868
TO FILTER OUT IMPURITIES.

00:00:49.868 --> 00:00:53.567
MAGNETS EXTRACT
ANY METAL CONTAMINANTS.

00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:57.200
WORKERS PREPARE A PREMIX
OF SUGAR, SALT, YEAST,

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.968
AND PRESERVATIVES.

00:00:58.968 --> 00:01:01.734
THEY COMBINE THESE INGREDIENTS
WITH THE SIFTED FLOUR

00:01:01.734 --> 00:01:04.801
IN A BIG MIXER AND ADD WATER.

00:01:04.801 --> 00:01:07.234
THE MIXER IS EQUIPPED
WITH NUMEROUS BARS

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:11.968
THAT ROTATE HORIZONTALLY
TO BLEND THE INGREDIENTS.

00:01:11.968 --> 00:01:16.234
THE OPERATOR OPENS THE MIXER
AND SPINS IT ONE MORE TIME

00:01:16.234 --> 00:01:18.567
TO EJECT THE DOUGH INTO A BIN.

00:01:18.567 --> 00:01:21.868
♪♪

00:01:21.868 --> 00:01:25.734
HE ROLLS THE BIN
TO THE NEXT STATION.

00:01:25.734 --> 00:01:29.000
HERE, THE PITA DOUGH
GOES INTO A HOPPER,

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.901
AND FROM THERE, IT DROPS INTO A
MACHINE CALLED A DOUGH DIVIDER.

00:01:32.901 --> 00:01:38.868
♪♪

00:01:38.868 --> 00:01:43.734
THIS MACHINE TURNS BIG CHUNKS
OF DOUGH INTO MANY SMALL BLOBS.

00:01:43.734 --> 00:01:47.467
TO DO THIS, IT FORCES THE DOUGH
THROUGH A ROUND HOLE,

00:01:47.467 --> 00:01:52.868
AND A GUILLOTINE BLADE CHOPS IT
TO THE CORRECT THICKNESS.

00:01:52.868 --> 00:01:55.167
THE DOUGH BLOBS RIDE A CONVEYOR

00:01:55.167 --> 00:01:58.767
AND PASS UNDER A ROLLER
THAT FLATTENS THEM.

00:01:58.767 --> 00:02:02.834
FLOUR FROM AN OVERHEAD SIFTER
DUSTS THE DOUGH BLOBS

00:02:02.834 --> 00:02:07.067
TO KEEP THEM FROM STICKING
TO THE MACHINERY.

00:02:07.067 --> 00:02:08.968
EACH ONE OF THESE FLATTENED
DOUGH BLOBS

00:02:08.968 --> 00:02:11.067
WILL EVENTUALLY BECOME A PITA.

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:14.067
♪♪

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:15.834
THE ROUND PIECES OF DOUGH

00:02:15.834 --> 00:02:18.634
NOW RIDE A CONVEYOR
UP TO A WARM ZONE.

00:02:18.634 --> 00:02:22.300
OVER A PERIOD OF 15 MINUTES,
THE YEAST FERMENTS,

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:24.934
CAUSING THE DOUGH TO RISE.

00:02:24.934 --> 00:02:26.934
OUT OF THE FERMENTATION STATION,

00:02:26.934 --> 00:02:31.968
A ROLLER FLATTENS
THE PITA-DOUGH SEGMENTS AGAIN.

00:02:31.968 --> 00:02:34.367
THEY'RE NOW READY
TO BE ROLLED VERY THIN

00:02:34.367 --> 00:02:36.734
IN A PROCESS KNOWN AS SHEETING.

00:02:36.734 --> 00:02:39.133
♪♪

00:02:39.133 --> 00:02:42.601
THE NEXT ROLLER PRESSES
THE PITA DOUGH MUCH THINNER.

00:02:42.601 --> 00:02:44.234
ROLLING IT IN ONE DIRECTION

00:02:44.234 --> 00:02:46.834
MAKES THE DOUGH SEGMENTS
OVAL-SHAPED.

00:02:46.834 --> 00:02:50.033
♪♪

00:02:50.033 --> 00:02:52.234
THE OVAL PITAS RIDE BY A PUSHER

00:02:52.234 --> 00:02:55.334
THAT NOW SHOVES THEM
TOWARDS THE FINAL ROLLER.

00:02:55.334 --> 00:02:57.133
♪♪

00:02:57.133 --> 00:03:00.801
IT ROLLS THE DOUGH IN THE OTHER
DIRECTION TO ROUND OUT THE SHAPE

00:03:00.801 --> 00:03:02.734
AND MAKE IT EVEN THINNER.

00:03:02.734 --> 00:03:06.234
♪♪

00:03:06.234 --> 00:03:08.200
PERFECTLY ROUND AND THIN,

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:12.067
THE PITAS NOW TRAVEL UP TO
ANOTHER FERMENTATION OPERATION.

00:03:12.067 --> 00:03:14.234
♪♪

00:03:14.234 --> 00:03:16.868
INSIDE,
THE TEMPERATURE IS TOASTY.

00:03:16.868 --> 00:03:19.267
IT'S WARM ENOUGH
TO REAWAKEN THE YEAST

00:03:19.267 --> 00:03:21.601
AND CAUSE THE DOUGH
TO RISE AGAIN.

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:24.968
♪♪

00:03:24.968 --> 00:03:27.767
CONVEYORS MOVE
IN CRISS-CROSS DIRECTIONS

00:03:27.767 --> 00:03:30.167
TO TAKE THE PITAS
BACK AND FORTH.

00:03:30.167 --> 00:03:35.067
THIS ZIGZAGGING JOURNEY
LASTS ABOUT 15 MINUTES.

00:03:35.067 --> 00:03:37.234
WHEN THE PITAS EMERGE
FROM THE CHAMBER,

00:03:37.234 --> 00:03:40.968
THEY HAVE
THICKENED UP SUBSTANTIALLY.

00:03:40.968 --> 00:03:44.267
THEY HEAD INTO AN OVEN
WHERE THE MAGIC HAPPENS.

00:03:44.267 --> 00:03:45.701
THE OVEN'S TEMPERATURE

00:03:45.701 --> 00:03:49.934
IS BETWEEN 750
AND 930 DEGREES FAHRENHEIT.

00:03:49.934 --> 00:03:52.400
THEY SPEND JUST
15 SECONDS IN IT.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:55.100
THIS FLASH-BAKING
CAUSES THE WATER IN THE DOUGH

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:56.534
TO TURN TO STEAM.

00:03:56.534 --> 00:04:00.934
THE STEAM PUFFS THE PITAS,
CREATING POCKETS INSIDE.

00:04:00.934 --> 00:04:03.133
THE PITAS THEN TRAVEL
ON CONVEYORS

00:04:03.133 --> 00:04:05.000
FOR A 20-MINUTE COOLDOWN.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.934
AS THEY COOL, THEY DEFLATE.

00:04:07.934 --> 00:04:11.167
THE PROCESS HAS CREATED POCKETS
IN THE PITAS.

00:04:11.167 --> 00:04:12.567
ONCE SLICED OPEN,

00:04:12.567 --> 00:04:16.267
THE POCKETS CAN BE STUFFED
TO CREATE SANDWICHES.

00:04:16.267 --> 00:04:20.968
WORKERS STACK THE PITAS
SIX HIGH FOR PACKAGING.

00:04:20.968 --> 00:04:23.133
THE NEXT CONVEYOR
DELIVERS THE STACKS

00:04:23.133 --> 00:04:27.067
INTO THE CLUTCH
OF AN AUTOMATED ARM.

00:04:27.067 --> 00:04:30.267
JUST AHEAD,
A BURST OF AIR OPENS A BAG,

00:04:30.267 --> 00:04:32.834
AND THE ARM
INSERTS THE PITAS INTO IT.

00:04:32.834 --> 00:04:38.267
AT THE SAME TIME, IT PUSHES
THE BAG ONTO THE NEXT CONVEYOR.

00:04:38.267 --> 00:04:40.534
MOVING FORWARD, ANOTHER DEVICE

00:04:40.534 --> 00:04:44.167
AUTOMATICALLY TWISTS
THE OPEN END OF THE BAG.

00:04:44.167 --> 00:04:46.334
THE DEVICE APPLIES
A PLASTIC LOCK TAB

00:04:46.334 --> 00:04:51.968
TO THE TWISTED END OF THE BAG,
SEALING THE PITA BREADS INSIDE.

00:04:51.968 --> 00:04:54.467
THE BAGS PASS BY
A METAL DETECTOR,

00:04:54.467 --> 00:04:56.901
AND THEN THEY'RE ON THEIR WAY
TO THE SUPERMARKET.

00:04:56.901 --> 00:05:01.267
♪♪

00:05:01.267 --> 00:05:05.534
THIS PITA BREAD HAS TAKEN
45 MINUTES TO MAKE AND PACKAGE,

00:05:05.534 --> 00:05:09.467
BUT IT SHOULD ENABLE LUNCH
TO COME TOGETHER VERY QUICKLY.

